ning R&D. Score 2.\n\nOriginality evidence: A centralized logging module with enforced APIs is a common, mundane engineering solution for regulatory compliance in software labs. Score 1.\n\nImplementability evidence: Integrating a mandatory API-based middleware into all existing and future high-risk pipelines requires substantial engineering effort, researcher retraining, and architectural changes. Score 2.\n\nAcceptability evidence: Automating compliance logging via internal software does not violate legal norms or business sensibilities and aligns with expected regulatory practice. Score 4.\n\nReturn.\n\n",
