anges. I'd say 3.\n\nWe need one sentence evidence each then score.\n\nProvide JSON? Output format unspecified but likely lines. Return rating echoing id exactly. Probably JSON with fields.\n\nWe can output:\n\nid: P1547\nparadigm_relatedness_evidence: ...\nparadigm_relatedness: 2\n...\n\nLet's produce.\n\nEnsure order listed.\n\nProceed.",
